Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHey, Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy who was sitting at\Nthat bench, do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE] Ah. You must\Nbe talking about Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.13,0:00:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,His mother used\Nto bring him here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.51,0:00:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,when she came to buy bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They would stop in quite often\Nback when he was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NI'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm totally starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, dear.\NIsn't Suzu coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.19,0:01:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Eri, don't!\NThose are still cooling off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Worth it though!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN'S CAT meows]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHILD B]\NHey, wait up! That's no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[STUDENTS chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I've seen you\Nsitting  here a time or tw--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[bicycle bell dings]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE]\NShun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you go grab some veggies?\NOh, um. Unless you're working.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not. What should I pick up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHere, from Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's nice. You tell her\Nthank you for us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this, Shun.\NIt's good for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NI'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. Thanks so much, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER A] Excuse me!\NCould I have, um, a curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get my apron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE]\NPlease! Thanks, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.17,0:03:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUEST D] 'Scuse me.\NDo you know where we check in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got you.\NJust take a seat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can show ya to your room\Nin a minute or two, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWho was this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER C]\NHeya! Can we order now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NUh, hey, you! Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we made too much bread.\NIn case you're hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Uh, no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It is late, huh?\NWanna take it for later?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you giving me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah. I was-- I mean, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a very kind\Ngesture. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all, don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:04:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this rain came\Noutta nowhere, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE]\NGlad you made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE]\NOh, Mio came by earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He left that to\Nthank us for the bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cutting from a\Nflower his mother grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE] I hear that Mio\Nlost his mother recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE] It was always\Njust the two of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so now he's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor boy isn't even out\Nof high school yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER]\NWell, Mio. I'm about to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I make?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We already had curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday and the day before,\Ntoo. Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I want... crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Is today a no-money day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER] No, it's fine.\NWe're having crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.41,0:06:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Krab with a "k" anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] Thanks for the meal!\NLet's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER]\NThis krab is....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER]\NYeah! It really is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NUh-huh! I'm havin' seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER]\NGo for it! We've got plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMind if I join?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank you for the flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHey, so, when you sit here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,are you watching for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Must get lonely,\Nalways here on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHuh? Oh, sorry, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's\Nalways watching me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's creepy, okay?\NWhat you're doing is creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE A] Doesn't Hashimoto\Nseem kinda femm-y to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point? Ya think\Nhe's a homo or somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE B] Crap, ya think?\NI sit right next to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE A]\NBetter watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE C] Hope he\Ndoesn't try to hit on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATES laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.59,0:07:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NHm? 'Bout time, ya bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to ya,\Nbut you collapsed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:07:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Suzu.\NSorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NWhat's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.23,0:08:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering what\Nmakes us all so afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,of two men or two\Nwomen being together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All the things we could fear in\Nthis world and we pick love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN'S CAT meowing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's just some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that you're in the\Nmiddle of writing a novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't the\Nactual manuscript,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it's more like outlining\Nand brainstorming, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.47,0:08:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it actually matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] What I said was\Nawful. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, why are\Nyou apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who came\Nup and bothered you--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NWith Mom gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone seems to think\Nthey know how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They see me as this\Npathetic, lonely vessel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,for their goodwill, and their\Npity makes it all worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of having people\Ntry to console me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought... that was\Nwhat you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you were wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.25,0:09:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I walked up\N'cause I was interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or curious,. I mean--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess maybe I just\Nneeded a pretext.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NWell, that's dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you even\Nneed a pretext?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, were you flirting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NIf you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI] Hey, Shun!\NAbout our plans for dinner--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Oh, my, oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings your beautiful\Nface back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Somethin' tells me you\Ndidn't come for the bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NEri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! That reminds me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOY A]\NCharge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOTHER A laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] Just making sure\Nthat's your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Yeah, it's spelled\Nwith the kanji for "horse."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You spell it with the kanji for\N"bearing fruit" and "center."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOTHER A] Would you like\Nanything special, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOY A]\NCurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOTHER A]\NYeah, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOY A]\NCurry! Curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOY A, MOTHER A]\NCurry! Curry! Curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOTHER A laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta say, Shun...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...you kinda suck at fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NWait, what? Where's the fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] I don't know,\Nthey weren't biting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Shun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to start\Nheading home, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going till\Nyou've had dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUZU]\NMh-hm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NAll right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[ALL chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're grateful for this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Mio,\Nthis all looks great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I did a lot of\Nhelping out at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE]\NHere you are, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NThanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We've tried to teach this one\Na few things, but he's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What even is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so ya know, Mio,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shun's been all\Nsorts'a concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,about your wellbeing lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Why would you say that?\NMind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NI said it 'cause it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.27,0:11:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the noise,\Ndon't pay any mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.23,0:11:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We never asked,\Ndo you like curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. I like--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NMh-hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Either shut your\Nmouth or stuff it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI] What, you think I won't\Ntalk with my mouth full?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NEri, will you please--?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NOh, babe! Pass me some chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUZU]\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NAre you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NI'm really, really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Why did you have to\Npick tonight to be yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE] My, Suzu, your\Npotato salad is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUZU] You think so?\NI'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NUgh... I ate too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NYeah, you were puttin' it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] I'm moving tomorrow...\Nto an orphanage on the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um, I need\Nyour number, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's-Where's your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 17. I'm too young to\Nmake my own choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you want, I can call\Nyou when I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NHey, Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't'cha give\Nme a hand here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.53,0:13:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Would you please\Nstop calling me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes me feel like I should be\Ngiving a lecture somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NYou good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWhat's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to flutter off to\Nyour private love nest with Suzu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and live your dream or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, did we do\Nsomething wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we hoarding\Nall the happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,for ourselves, Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Just shut up and\Nget outta here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI] Say, the next tenant's\Ns'posed to show up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,any minute, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you serious?\NThat's news to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Auntie wanted to bring in\Nanother pair of hands
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,to help out around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans] Whatever, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShun? You asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NBeen a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAT A meows]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMio?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Good to see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh! Hold on, does this mean\Nthat the new tenant is you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NMh-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be living here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure am! I'm 20,\NI can live where I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And Eri told me how to make\Nmyself useful around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I never forgot about you, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you. And now that I'm\Nback, you can like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,--[SUZU crying]\N--[ERI laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. Way to go, Romeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NShut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI] This property comes\Nwith some perks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed\Nto be moving out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your giggling!\NIt encourages her! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI, SUZU]\NCongratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NThank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Why must my\Nsuffering be endless?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NAre these flowers...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,From the cutting you gave me?\NYeah, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I planted them and they sprouted\Nright up, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have gotten a lot\Ntaller, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio, this life isn't--\NYou have to think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had three years\Nto think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you should've\Nthought longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NMaybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kay, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] Shun, there's no need\Nto overthink this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be with you.\NThat's why I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] So, yeah.\NLet's go get some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!\NHang on a minute. Shun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NOh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back home, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh... Forgot\Nto say it sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NGood to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHey, Mom. Hey, Dad. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[door opens]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs] It's so cool in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why haven't you eaten\Nyour breakfast yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NMakin' any progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NNo. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NUh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hey. Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:16:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you manage to get some?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The cooling patches?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I forgot! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta head to work now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but I promise I'll pick\Nthem up on my way home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE]\NAnother job, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NYup. I'll be back this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE]\NHere you are, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NGot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your braised pork belly.\NAnd here's your tofu stir-fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.83,0:17:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG WOMAN A]\NLive here on the island, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, "kiddo"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG WOMAN B]\NAww, a local!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.47,0:17:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chibana! Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And how old?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG WOMEN]\NSo young!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG WOMAN B]\NSo, do you have a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG WOMAN A]\NAw, look, he's blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOUNG WOMEN]\NSo cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.81,0:17:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shun, the bath is free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna go\Nstraight to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.11,0:17:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, do you\Nmind if I join ya tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:17:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWhat? Of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being way too forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to use your head, Mio.\NJust think before you act.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NMommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio, you made these\Nall by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] I sure did!\NWas I a very big help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER]\NMh-hm! This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You were an enormous he... help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NTry 'em, try 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER]\NOkay, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm! It's delicious!\NThank you so much, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NYou're welcome, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still awake, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NMio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming over tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything in particular\Nya wanna have for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NCurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NYou do love your curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So... what're the deets\Non your new life
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,with Professor Loveypants?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NUh, there's not much to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NOh, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\N'Sup, ya arrogant jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWhat'd I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NTake a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to actually\Nspend time with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are ya pretending to be\Ntoo busy? So lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NI am hardly pretending!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When you supposed\Nto send that in by?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.31,0:20:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NYesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.15,0:20:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.23,0:20:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] If I ship it\Ntomorrow, I'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to ya,\Nbut I don't think you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are a busy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWell, so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.95,0:20:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWith your customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, at the cafe?\NThat doesn't really compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw. You're a real\Nhit there, "kiddo."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:21:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's your\Nproblem? That really--!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NOh, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUZU] Care for a donut?\NThey're fresh from the fryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.39,0:21:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what? Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Eri! Slow it down!\NYou already had a bunch at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it; your\Ndonuts are just so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUZU sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You two sure get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we do.\NSuzu's actually kind-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And not just some dour\Nlittle troll. Right, Shun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NYa finish your thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Gonna make a quick\Ntrip to the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Like right now?\NWhat do you need there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NTo ship this by air.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.97,0:21:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Well, have a good trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio, you should maybe,\NI don't know, go with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.93,0:21:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps] Uh, well, I would,\Nbut I'm needed at the café.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.89,0:21:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.31,0:22:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and Suzu can fill in\Nfor you, no problem, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUZU]\NHuh? Oh! Sure! You two have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NUm, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.49,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For a job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.08,0:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWhat's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NThe hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. I have a hard time with\Neye contact and strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And the mainland's crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.47,0:22:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You do fine with\Ncustomers at the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.31,0:22:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's something I've\Nhad to work real hard at.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I had no clue.\NYou don't mess around, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHeh. I guess not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Bet you could find\Nyourself a girlfriend easy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.69,0:22:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,if ya tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like such a waste to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NWha--?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.67,0:23:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kay, I'm going to the airport.\NHow' bout you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.34,0:23:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.27,0:23:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[inaudible]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.36,0:23:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NUm, pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But could I ask you\Nif you like men?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're a bit\Nyoung for me, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I-- That...\Nisn't the reason I asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.59,0:23:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy... Well,\Nhe held my hand once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.39,0:23:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's been in my\Nhead ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.51,0:23:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about\Nthis stuff, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping maybe I could\Nask you some things?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.60,0:24:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You give me a call, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing harder than a soda\Nfor you though, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[phone buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMio? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NYou think I'm stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.97,0:24:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Like some kind of worked-up kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I came back\Nhere without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.22,0:24:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am not a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.18,0:24:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are the only\Nthing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.89,0:24:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I love you, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.11,0:24:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I need to know.\NDo you feel the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.28,0:24:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you glad I came back?\NDo you want me to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.12,0:25:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.49,0:25:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NIn Sakurazaka by Mimi's bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.17,0:25:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NI'm on my way to you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.87,0:25:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.51,0:25:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE A] Doesn't Hashimoto\Nseem kinda femm-y to you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.56,0:25:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE B]\NOh, yeah, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.35,0:25:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE C]\NWhat's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.23,0:25:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya think he's a homo\Nor somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.77,0:25:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE A]\NBetter watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.94,0:25:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATE C] Hope he\Ndoesn't try to hit on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSMATES laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.64,0:26:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMio.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.43,0:26:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] These feelings didn't come\Nout of nowhere, Shun, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.94,0:26:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you liked me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.19,0:26:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.07,0:26:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So why tell me to\Nfind a girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.78,0:26:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,when you know that\Nyou're what I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.03,0:26:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NC'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.50,0:26:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NAppreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.83,0:26:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[HOTEL STAFF A]\NThank you very much, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.62,0:26:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Breakfast will be served...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.63,0:26:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUEST A] Hey. Take\Na look at those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUEST C]\NWhat? At the front desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.51,0:26:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[HOTEL STAFF A] Oh,\Nand checkout will be at 10 am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.76,0:26:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUEST B]\NOh, no. He saw me looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.88,0:26:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUEST C]\NShh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[HOTEL STAFF A]\NAnd that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.84,0:26:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your room key.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.85,0:26:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take the\Nelevator to your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.72,0:26:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NGot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.64,0:26:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.52,0:26:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shun? Will you\Nplease talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.44,0:26:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shun. What are--?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.92,0:27:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NYou should never have come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.84,0:27:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.09,0:27:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want this, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.13,0:27:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You should just forget me\Nwhile you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You would be happier\Nwith a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.64,0:27:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.97,0:27:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hold you back,\Nbut... but I can't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.70,0:27:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMind if I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever slept\Nwith a girl before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.74,0:27:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh. Yeah. I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.79,0:27:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMe, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.37,0:27:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NYou're able to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.71,0:27:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMore or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.92,0:27:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I've never\Nactually done it with a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.75,0:28:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Never? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.63,0:28:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I've never told\Na man I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.43,0:28:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All the guys I've\Nliked were my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.26,0:28:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to say nothing than\Nwatch it all go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.81,0:28:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.02,0:28:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.31,0:28:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I did make the first\Nmove with you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.90,0:28:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.78,0:28:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shun! Let's make love now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.65,0:28:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.70,0:28:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I haven't slept\Nin about three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.24,0:28:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sleep after!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.70,0:28:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just too sudden, okay?\NIt isn't gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.25,0:28:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--? C'mon,\Nit'll work if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shun! I've been wai--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.68,0:28:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NOh. Rice balls. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.19,0:28:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NAww. Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.07,0:29:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to\Nfall asleep on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.99,0:29:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.14,0:29:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NShun?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.56,0:29:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up. They're ready for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.85,0:29:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. You look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.94,0:29:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. This is real, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.65,0:29:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be married soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.61,0:29:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?\NI need you to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.24,0:29:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.46,0:30:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.89,0:30:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN A] Don't worry,\NMom's gonna love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.14,0:30:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN B]\NYou think?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.11,0:30:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So can we have sex toni--?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.07,0:30:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NNope.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.66,0:30:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.45,0:30:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NCould you keep it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.83,0:30:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scaring the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.95,0:30:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?\NDon't you wanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.54,0:30:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NI do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.97,0:30:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI love you, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.55,0:30:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NI love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.72,0:30:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now would you go\Nto work already?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.89,0:30:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Could'ja say that again first?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.14,0:30:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NNope. Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.56,0:31:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NAw, why not? C'mon, Shun!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.69,0:31:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, you'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.15,0:31:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] I will, I will.\NC'mon, just once?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.82,0:31:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NShun!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.20,0:31:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.96,0:31:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Hey, who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.29,0:31:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an old childhood friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.92,0:31:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And your fiancée, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.47,0:31:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NFormer fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know I was here?\NAnd why are you here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.56,0:31:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I would think that'd be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.64,0:31:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I came because you need\Nto come back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.58,0:31:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back from the post office--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.24,0:31:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHey. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.33,0:32:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Sakurako.\NWe sort of met earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.50,0:32:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, my name's Chibana. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.88,0:32:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So how long have you\Nand Shun been friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.26,0:32:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.88,0:32:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHe's not my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.01,0:32:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I've been telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.81,0:32:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio's my lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.52,0:32:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That all for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.10,0:32:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NUh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NCool. Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.98,0:32:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NWhat was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.11,0:32:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWhat was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.82,0:32:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you have\Npreferred "boyfriend"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.49,0:32:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.78,0:32:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No! That's not it at all!\NStop playing dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you two really engaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.24,0:32:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I broke it off ages ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.99,0:32:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and cut off my whole\Nfamily in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.58,0:32:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NOh. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.30,0:32:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.13,0:32:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.34,0:32:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My family wants me to come\Nback for a visit. Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.01,0:33:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] But that's easier\Nsaid than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.14,0:33:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.60,0:33:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.23,0:33:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO] Do you have\Ntime to spare today?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.65,0:33:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.28,0:33:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.66,0:33:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NWhere's Shun?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHe's busy working. Prob'ly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.49,0:33:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.91,0:33:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I suppose\Nyou'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.37,0:33:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.46,0:33:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to give you\Na tour of the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.25,0:33:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's mostly just\Nocean and mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.34,0:33:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd rather you\Nshowed me the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.13,0:33:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NYeah? Do you not like the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.22,0:33:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I live in a port town,\Nso I've seen it enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NSo...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.98,0:33:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.85,0:33:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO] Have you and\NShun... slept together?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's a "no."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.12,0:34:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's better than\Nyou might imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.41,0:34:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentle. Considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.45,0:34:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time and he still\Nhasn't managed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.96,0:34:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You really should do it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.59,0:34:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NSakurako! Hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.72,0:34:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask, but did you come\Nhere to get back with Shun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.56,0:34:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think?\NNo, perish the thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.39,0:34:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you haven't heard\Na word I've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO] I'm here because his\Nfather's health is failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent a letter.\NDidn't he get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.07,0:34:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he read it,\Nbut is it that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.74,0:34:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he running out of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.62,0:34:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NIf he doesn't go now...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.37,0:34:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't see him soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.33,0:34:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...I don't think he'll\Never see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.42,0:34:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] I have to ask. Why did\Nyou decide to marry Shun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.51,0:35:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NBecause he said it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.72,0:35:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you knew\Nhe could never love a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.22,0:35:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You did know. You had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.61,0:35:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[TEAM chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.62,0:35:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Or ten. Hell, let's\Ntake a quick nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.91,0:35:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.80,0:35:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NCouldn't you just hand it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.10,0:35:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really not\Ngonna tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.18,0:35:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\N'Course not. Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NWho knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.06,0:35:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It might actually\Nwork out this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.85,0:35:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.81,0:35:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's impossible, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.44,0:35:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't tell him,\Nthen it may as well be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.73,0:36:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to take the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.07,0:36:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NGather your courage and try.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.87,0:36:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] You don't understand,\Nand you never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.29,0:36:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NYou're a novelist, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.01,0:36:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can write from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.84,0:36:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So come back home\Nthis one time, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.97,0:36:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NDon't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.39,0:36:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys. I cut up some\Nwatermelon for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] I certainly don't feel\Nlike coming home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.81,0:36:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what're you even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.69,0:36:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you barge in on\Nme all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.98,0:36:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go and mind your\Nown family's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.94,0:36:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't have anything\Nto do with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.57,0:36:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shun! You need to\Ntake that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.86,0:36:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[slap]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.62,0:36:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You selfish child.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.62,0:36:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you\Nwere this stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:37:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] Hold on! No, please.\NSakurako, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.92,0:37:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! We need to\Ngo after her, Shun!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.51,0:37:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NI've got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.39,0:37:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So why would I ever\Ngo back to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.64,0:37:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You have me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.60,0:37:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.23,0:37:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NAre you--?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.23,0:37:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not possible that\Nyou're trying to use me
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.44,0:37:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,as an excuse to run from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.61,0:37:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.82,0:37:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShun!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.23,0:37:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If he dies, you can\Nnever see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.15,0:37:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind me. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.32,0:37:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.67,0:37:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NUh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.94,0:38:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.99,0:38:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[meows]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.25,0:38:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NDon't you start.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.96,0:38:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN'S FATHER] First you run\Noff, abandoning your bride,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you're telling us\Nthat you like men?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.76,0:38:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?\NHow can you do this now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN'S MOTHER]\NIt's not true. Is it, Shun?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.64,0:38:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say it's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.97,0:38:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NYou selfish child.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.60,0:38:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you\Nwere this stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.60,0:38:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NNever mind me. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.73,0:38:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.53,0:38:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NDammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN'S MOTHER] Here, I'll\Ntake one of the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, give me some smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.09,0:39:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN'S FATHER]\NSo serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.85,0:39:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN'S MOTHER laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.97,0:39:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right though.\NThey're still adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.39,0:39:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO] Hey, Auntie!\NWe got that sweet rice drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.56,0:39:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Get some amazake  ?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.73,0:39:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And the two of you are sharing,\Nright? That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.56,0:39:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NOh, and, Auntie, Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.61,0:39:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We talked, and once\Nwe're all grown up,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.19,0:39:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be Shun's wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.90,0:39:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN'S FATHER laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.03,0:39:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Well done, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.16,0:39:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NI really am!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.24,0:39:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know because he promised.\NRight? Tell 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.50,0:39:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. As long as\Nit's you, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NSakurako!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.38,0:39:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't be\Nout here all by yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.22,0:39:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,especially not at night, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.14,0:39:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.76,0:39:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head back.\NPlease, I'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.52,0:40:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NYou should've told him, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.14,0:40:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had told Shun that\Nyou needed him here,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.90,0:40:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he would've stayed\Nwithout a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.02,0:40:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.32,0:40:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't want him\Nto leave you behind--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.82,0:40:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,why not say how you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.53,0:40:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I could ask you\Nthe same thing, couldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.28,0:40:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NExcept I did say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.58,0:40:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be with him,\Neven if he could never love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.17,0:40:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.05,0:40:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NSakurako.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.76,0:40:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hide\Nhim away from his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.05,0:40:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not be the last\Nperson he loves either.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.97,0:40:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That choice is his...\Nand he has to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.23,0:40:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't think that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.98,0:40:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Because whether he sees it\Nor not, Shun needs you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.73,0:40:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI'm... sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.73,0:40:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.78,0:40:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know me.\NWe're strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.78,0:40:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI know you love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.07,0:40:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just what\Nthat looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.20,0:41:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know because I love him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.62,0:41:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.01,0:41:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.72,0:41:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If only Shun were seeing\Nsome kind of lowlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.27,0:41:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This'd be so much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.15,0:41:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NWhen I was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.19,0:41:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom always said that\Nif I came here alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.61,0:41:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be swept away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.78,0:41:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Swept away?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.15,0:41:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. To the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.66,0:41:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been there\Nfor a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.41,0:41:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still miss her.\NI'm still sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.08,0:41:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So if Shun's parents\Nare asking for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.04,0:41:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,...then I want him\Nto go and see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.75,0:41:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER, MIO laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.47,0:41:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER]\NYou're so fast, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.39,0:42:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am!\NTry to keep up, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.81,0:42:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.94,0:42:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NActually, could you carry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.85,0:42:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO'S MOTHER]\NOkay! Hyup!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.61,0:42:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH]\NSqueeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.36,0:42:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You smell good. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.03,0:42:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Squeeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.96,0:42:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMio!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.75,0:42:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why didn't you answer\Nyour phone when I called you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.42,0:42:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you know I'd be worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.22,0:42:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, uh, I don't have it.\NThink I left it in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.76,0:42:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Thus defeating the\Npurpose of a cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.76,0:42:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So how did it go?\NIs Sakurako all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI took her back to her inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.35,0:42:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.90,0:42:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShe said not to come by today.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.78,0:42:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.40,0:42:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NYou must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.57,0:43:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.66,0:43:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Sorry for dragging\Nyou into my mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.99,0:43:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.50,0:43:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NBut when someone cares for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.25,0:43:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe try not to\Ncrush their spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.38,0:43:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you handled that
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.42,0:43:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,as horribly as you\Npossibly could've, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.80,0:43:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being so selfish\Nand grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.22,0:43:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.43,0:43:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw. I'm kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.10,0:43:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I getcha?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.85,0:43:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NI really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.14,0:43:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NAww.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.56,0:43:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAT A meows]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NWell, you've worn me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.44,0:43:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All of my patience is spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.07,0:43:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NSakurako, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.02,0:43:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye forever.\NHave a pleasant life.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.98,0:43:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I'm an outsider\Nto your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.78,0:43:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.24,0:43:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] Uh. Now, now.\NLet's stop there, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.08,0:43:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know he didn't\Nmean that, Sakurako.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.54,0:43:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO] Please just go home.\NYour father's health is--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.54,0:43:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Failing, I know.\NI did read the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.25,0:43:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO]\NI see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.09,0:44:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shun? Kiss me\Nfarewell, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.38,0:44:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.26,0:44:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NWhat the hell--?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.30,0:44:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it, and then\NI can give up on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.60,0:44:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Shun!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.97,0:44:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never done it before,\Nnot even when we were engaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.39,0:44:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.52,0:44:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO] He's better\Nthan you might imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.40,0:44:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentle. Considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.82,0:44:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.15,0:44:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NSakurako, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.55,0:44:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[horn blares]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.67,0:44:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I--
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.09,0:44:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking for a kiss\Nfrom you, you stupid jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.22,0:44:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NSorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.68,0:44:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shun might've been cool with it,\Nbut I'm young and possessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.52,0:44:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya later, Sakurako!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.56,0:45:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAKURAKO] I'm never coming back\Nto this island. It's all yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.28,0:45:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] So passes the\Nstorm of the century.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.33,0:45:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head back.\NI need some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.75,0:45:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.00,0:45:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, that really hurt, Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.38,0:45:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.08,0:45:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've said "I can't"
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.96,0:45:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as she asked\Nfor that kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.30,0:45:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't stepped in like\NI did, you'd've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.09,0:45:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd've kissed her\Nright in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.18,0:45:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NEh? Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.64,0:45:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so frickin'\Nover this! Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.90,0:45:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHuh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.86,0:45:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHey, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.61,0:45:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShut up and leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.95,0:45:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NIt's dinnertime.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.03,0:45:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI'm not hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.50,0:45:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Auntie? Mio isn't\Ngonna eat until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.37,0:45:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE]\NOh, honey. Did you have a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.21,0:46:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.38,0:46:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.88,0:46:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE] Well, then maybe\Nyou should eat later, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.34,0:46:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN grumbles]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.09,0:46:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.39,0:46:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.94,0:46:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Mio, what's up?\NYou still sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.69,0:46:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.61,0:46:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, what is it with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.57,0:46:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I make\Nyou cry all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.49,0:46:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You do. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.91,0:46:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up. I'm still mad--
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.59,0:46:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.51,0:46:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when you're this close\Nand in need of comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.64,0:46:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.64,0:46:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.02,0:46:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NHuh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.10,0:46:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing this right!\NClothes off!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.77,0:47:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NListen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.98,0:47:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you... Are you really\Nsure you wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.15,0:47:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.82,0:47:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] I just don't want you\Nto do anything you'll regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.78,0:47:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NShun, I'm not gonna--
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.53,0:47:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.45,0:47:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Clothes off. This is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.87,0:47:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.52,0:47:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] Hey, would you--?\NCan you top?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.90,0:47:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.65,0:47:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Shun.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.73,0:47:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I could\Nhold out for very long!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.69,0:47:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You just came, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.90,0:47:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could\Njust give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.41,0:47:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO] I mean, if it's what\Nyou want, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.91,0:47:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.49,0:47:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, can you get\Nover that quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.87,0:47:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm a bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.12,0:48:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus I already took a bath\Nand did some other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.04,0:48:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What other stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.96,0:48:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.88,0:48:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.43,0:48:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI'm gonna put my finger in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.10,0:48:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you already\Nprep yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.65,0:48:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta teach\Nme how after this,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.48,0:48:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,then I can do it\Nfor you sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.78,0:48:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, fine, okay,\Nwhatever! Put it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.04,0:48:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHere goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.46,0:48:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shun, does it feel okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.51,0:48:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.43,0:49:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NTo one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.35,0:49:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...be with someone I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.27,0:49:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too much is it?\NYou want me to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.40,0:49:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NNot ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.73,0:49:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NTo lie in his arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.57,0:49:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, it was a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.53,0:49:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,that I never thought\Nwould come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.13,0:49:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NYou okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.55,0:49:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NDrink?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.47,0:49:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NNo. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.35,0:49:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some tempura?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.22,0:49:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NNah. It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.48,0:49:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are ya sure? Lucky me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.07,0:49:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] I feel like I never\Ndid a thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.36,0:49:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sure ya did.\NYou were great!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.78,0:50:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN] I'm not talkin'\Nabout that, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.41,0:50:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know,\NI really do love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.58,0:50:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,More than you know.\NMore than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.54,0:50:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to find a way\Nto prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.88,0:50:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya let me eat all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. That's not what\NI mean, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.88,0:50:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You did something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.30,0:50:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I only liked girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.18,0:50:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but then I met you,\Nand I knew I loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.27,0:50:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And somehow, I knew it\Nwas all gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.03,0:50:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NListen, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.03,0:50:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.41,0:50:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NI'm gonna go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.59,0:51:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\N'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.10,0:51:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[AUNTIE] You've really\Ntidied up, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.48,0:51:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's been comin' along.\NSorry for rushin' off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.98,0:51:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fret about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.44,0:51:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Take all the time you need\Nto care for your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.69,0:51:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And if there's anything I can\Ndo to help, just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.28,0:51:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Thanks, Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.58,0:51:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMio, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.75,0:51:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop watching me.\NWhat you're doing is creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.92,0:51:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.55,0:51:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.55,0:51:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hokkaido's pretty\Nchilly, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.89,0:51:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to catch a cold there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.02,0:51:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll write you. Or call. I do\Nhave a cellphone this time--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.10,0:51:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you good with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.40,0:51:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you could come with--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.73,0:51:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be gone a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.44,0:52:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just gonna\Nwait here... like I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.83,0:52:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, say what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.71,0:52:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.25,0:52:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you.\NSo please, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.01,0:52:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NOf course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.22,0:52:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go where you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.22,0:52:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be\Nwithout you. Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.52,0:52:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't cry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.77,0:52:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.27,0:52:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NHey, Shun? Let's get wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.11,0:52:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.49,0:52:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NAh! Whoa! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.24,0:52:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio! Ah! It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.78,0:52:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.87,0:52:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shun?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.70,0:52:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NUh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.70,0:52:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NI'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.92,0:52:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.46,0:52:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.38,0:53:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NYeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.26,0:53:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NCome on, just a littel further.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.47,0:53:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NNo! No, we go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.59,0:53:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.06,0:53:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NThere.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.31,0:53:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad, take care\Ntill I get back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.95,0:53:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.54,0:53:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'd better get\Na move on. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.02,0:53:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NAll right. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.56,0:53:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.23,0:53:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.90,0:53:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.94,0:54:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[ERI]\NShun! Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.07,0:54:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The ferry's gonna\Nleave without ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.24,0:54:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.58,0:54:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHUN]\NMio? You with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.13,0:54:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[MIO]\NComing!
